E AX3040 347-result-only-tyvar.ax:29:5-12 result-only-tyvar "`conjure` returns type variable `a`, which no parameter mentions, and its body produces that result rather than never returning: the caller chooses the type and a `cast` fabricates the value" ?"three ways out: return a concrete word type and let callers write `cast`; or make it DIVERGE, so every path ends in a call that never returns, which is what makes `for all a` honest; or tag the declaration `;@axiom:raw` to put it in the unsafe layer on purpose"
